{
    "title": "TouchTunes: Play the jukebox",
    "description": "PLAY THE MUSIC YOU LOVE WITH TOUCHTUNES! \r\n\r\nWant to hear your favorite music right now? Do you have the perfect song to make this moment unforgettable? Download the TouchTunes app and unlock access to all things music.  \r\n\r\nACCESS 65,000 JUKEBOXES IN BARS, RESTAURANTS, AND HOT SPOTS \r\n\r\nWith the TouchTunes app, you can connect to over 65,000 jukeboxes across bars, restaurants, and local hot spots on two continents. The music that sets your vibe right is always at your fingertips. Enjoy a dynamic, personalized experience with curated playlists and song recommendations, ensuring you\u2019ll never be out in a boring location EVER AGAIN! \r\n\r\nTOUCHTUNES: THE LEADER IN CONNECTED MUSIC EXPEREINCES \r\n\r\nExperience music like never before and connect with other music lovers where you are. You won\u2019t find that in many places. As the leader in the social music industry, TouchTunes turns any location into a party. Discover why no one does it like TouchTunes! \r\n\r\nTOUCHTUNES KEY FEATURES: \r\n\r\n\u2022 Interactive Map: Find TouchTunes locations and explore their music vibe. \r\n\u2022 Earn Perks: The more songs you play, the more free song credits and other perks you earn. \r\n\u2022 Never-Expiring Credits: Purchased credits are valid at any mobile-enabled TouchTunes jukebox. \r\n\u2022 Easy Search: Browse the catalog and quickly find your favorite songs, artists, and albums. \r\n\u2022 Fresh Playlists: Enjoy song recommendations that keep your playlists fresh. \r\n\u2022 Top Played & Viral Songs: Discover top-played and viral songs. \r\n\u2022 Fast Pass: Skip the wait and hear your song faster. \r\n\u2022 Full Queue: See the entire queue of upcoming songs. \r\n\u2022 Multiple Payment Options: Buy credits using debit or credit card, PayPal\u00ae, Venmo\u00ae (US), Apple Pay\u00ae, or Google Play\u00ae. \r\n\u2022 Support: Our support team is ready to assist you in the app\u2019s Help Center. \r\n\r\nSTAY CONNECTED WITH TOUCHTUNES \r\n\r\nFor exclusive content and updates, follow @TouchTunes on Facebook, Instagram, TikTok, Threads, and X. Share your night out with #TouchTunes for a chance to be featured. \r\n\r\nFEEDBACK \r\n\r\nHave feedback? Email us at general@touchtunes.com  \r\n\r\nNote: Jukebox must be mobile-enabled and located in the country where the credits were purchased.",
    "descriptionHTML": "PLAY THE MUSIC YOU LOVE WITH TOUCHTUNES! <br><br>Want to hear your favorite music right now? Do you have the perfect song to make this moment unforgettable? Download the TouchTunes app and unlock access to all things music.  <br><br>ACCESS 65,000 JUKEBOXES IN BARS, RESTAURANTS, AND HOT SPOTS <br><br>With the TouchTunes app, you can connect to over 65,000 jukeboxes across bars, restaurants, and local hot spots on two continents. The music that sets your vibe right is always at your fingertips. Enjoy a dynamic, personalized experience with curated playlists and song recommendations, ensuring you\u2019ll never be out in a boring location EVER AGAIN! <br><br>TOUCHTUNES: THE LEADER IN CONNECTED MUSIC EXPEREINCES <br><br>Experience music like never before and connect with other music lovers where you are. You won\u2019t find that in many places. As the leader in the social music industry, TouchTunes turns any location into a party. Discover why no one does it like TouchTunes! <br><br>TOUCHTUNES KEY FEATURES: <br><br>\u2022 Interactive Map: Find TouchTunes locations and explore their music vibe. <br>\u2022 Earn Perks: The more songs you play, the more free song credits and other perks you earn. <br>\u2022 Never-Expiring Credits: Purchased credits are valid at any mobile-enabled TouchTunes jukebox. <br>\u2022 Easy Search: Browse the catalog and quickly find your favorite songs, artists, and albums. <br>\u2022 Fresh Playlists: Enjoy song recommendations that keep your playlists fresh. <br>\u2022 Top Played &amp; Viral Songs: Discover top-played and viral songs. <br>\u2022 Fast Pass: Skip the wait and hear your song faster. <br>\u2022 Full Queue: See the entire queue of upcoming songs. <br>\u2022 Multiple Payment Options: Buy credits using debit or credit card, PayPal\u00ae, Venmo\u00ae (US), Apple Pay\u00ae, or Google Play\u00ae. <br>\u2022 Support: Our support team is ready to assist you in the app\u2019s Help Center. <br><br>STAY CONNECTED WITH TOUCHTUNES <br><br>For exclusive content and updates, follow @TouchTunes on Facebook, Instagram, TikTok, Threads, and X. Share your night out with #TouchTunes for a chance to be featured. <br><br>FEEDBACK <br><br>Have feedback? Email us at general@touchtunes.com  <br><br>Note: Jukebox must be mobile-enabled and located in the country where the credits were purchased.",
